      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضرّسهُ</span></b>  inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَضْرِيسٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَسَهُ</span>, in five
