       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَضْرِيسٌ</span> also signifies (tropical:)  <i>An indentation,</i>
or <i>serration,</i> (Az, TA,) <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَضْرَاس</span>, (TA,) in a
sapphire (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَاقُوتَة</span>) and a pearl, or in wood. (Az,
TA.)

